  {
   "turn": 2,
   "response_text": "This is very concerning! The validation accuracy is around 0.941-0.945, which is significantly **above** the healthy range of 0.8538-0.8599. This is a major anomaly. Let me check the training logs to understand what happened:",
   "tool_calls": [
